> **Next.** Drafts, cross-critique, one joint design, then the vote. No executor and no code before that. In the morning you get the true state: either the design as an Artifact with a sign-off poll, or "still running" with a poll to move the deadline or waive the brainstorm. A split between the voters waits for you.
>
